import ../../../site/games/river/playback.dl

set playback to a new website river playback
set playback's speed to 1
set playback's trace to website river trace from (the string form of "RIVER|COMMAND|LOAD|SHEEP\nRIVER|ACTION|LOAD|SHEEP\nRIVER|COMMAND|CROSS\nRIVER|ACTION|CROSS|FAR\nRIVER|COMMAND|UNLOAD|SHEEP\nRIVER|ACTION|UNLOAD|SHEEP\n") dropping 2 source lines
require condition ((the website river trace error in (playback's trace))'s length = 0) reporting "A valid replay failed validation"
begin website river replay in (the address of playback) stepping true
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 0.3
require condition ((playback's scene's cargo = 0) and (playback's elapsed = 0.3)) reporting "A transition committed before its animation finished"
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 1.0
require condition ((playback's paused) and ((playback's scene's cargo = 1) and (playback's position = 2))) reporting "Step crossed an instruction boundary"
require condition ((playback's shown position = 1) and (playback's seconds = 0.56)) reporting "Step highlighted an instruction that had not run or consumed its time"
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 5.0
require condition ((playback's scene's bank = 0) and (playback's elapsed = 0.0)) reporting "A paused replay advanced"
set playback's paused to false
set playback's stepping to false
set playback's speed to 2
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 0.5
require condition ((playback's scene's bank = 1) and (playback's scene's cargo = 1)) reporting "Playback speed did not control crossing time"
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 0.28
require condition ((playback's playing = false) and ((playback's deliveries = 1) and (playback's passenger))) reporting "A safe unfinished plan did not stop or record its distinct goals"
require condition ((playback's scene's bank = 1) and ((the item at 0 in (playback's scene's passengers)) = 1)) reporting "An incomplete plan reset the world"
free website river trace the address of (playback's trace)
set playback's trace to website river trace from (the string form of "RIVER|COMMAND|CROSS\nRIVER|ACTION|CROSS|FAR\nRIVER|DANGER|WOLF|SHEEP\nRIVER|ERROR|The wolf ate the sheep.\n") dropping 2 source lines
begin website river replay in (the address of playback) stepping false
set playback's speed to 1
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 2.5
require condition ((playback's stage = 2) and (playback's scene's predator = 2)) reporting "A failure skipped its danger animation or reset delay"
advance website river playback (the address of playback) by 2.4
require condition ((playback's playing = false) and ((playback's scene's bank = 0) and (playback's message = "The wolf ate the sheep."))) reporting "A failed plan did not reset while retaining its feedback"
free website river trace the address of (playback's trace)
set playback's trace to website river trace from (the string form of "RIVER|COMMAND|LOAD|SHEEP\nRIVER|ACTION|LOAD|SHEEP\nRIVER|ACTION|LOAD|WOLF\n") dropping 2 source lines
require condition ((the website river trace error in (playback's trace))'s length > 0) reporting "An inconsistent protocol was accepted before playback"
free website river trace the address of (playback's trace)
print line "River playback steps at instruction boundaries, pauses exactly, changes speed, records goals and resets failures after impact."
